const coins=[['bitcoin','비트코인','BTC','₿'],['ethereum','이더리움','ETH','Ξ'],['ripple','리플','XRP','X'],['solana','솔라나','SOL','◎']];let currency='usd',selected='bitcoin',market=[],reports=[],busy=false;const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const money=n=>Number.isFinite(n)?new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR',{style:'currency',currency:currency.toUpperCase(),maximumFractionDigits:currency==='krw'?0:2}).format(n):'—';const compact=n=>Number.isFinite(n)?new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR',{notation:'compact',maximumFractionDigits:1}).format(n):'—';function render(){ $('cards').replaceChildren();$('coin-tabs').replaceChildren();for(const [id,name,ticker,symbol]of coins){const c=market.find(x=>x.id===id)||{};const change=c.price_change_percentage_24h;const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='coin'+(id===selected?' active':'');b.innerHTML='<div class="coin-name"><span class="coin-symbol">'+symbol+'</span>'+name+'<span class="ticker">'+ticker+'</span></div><div class="price">'+money(c.current_price)+'</div><div class="change '+(change>=0?'up':'down')+'">'+(Number.isFinite(change)?(change>=0?'▲ ':'▼ ')+Math.abs(change).toFixed(2)+'%':'—')+' <span class="change">24시간</span></div><div class="metrics"><span>시가총액<b>'+compact(c.market_cap)+'</b></span><span>24h 거래량<b>'+compact(c.total_volume)+'</b></span></div>';b.onclick=()=>{selected=id;render();draw()};$('cards').append(b);const tab=document.createElement('button');tab.textContent=ticker;tab.className=id===selected?'active':'';tab.onclick=b.onclick;$('coin-tabs').append(tab)}}function draw(){const name=coins.find(c=>c[0]===selected)[1];$('chart-title').textContent=name+' 가격 추이';const values=market.find(c=>c.id===selected)?.sparkline_in_7d?.price?.filter(Number.isFinite)||[];if(values.length<2){$('chart').className='chart-empty';$('chart').textContent='가격 데이터를 연결하면 최근 7일 그래프가 표시됩니다.';$('range').textContent='';return}const lo=Math.min(...values),hi=Math.max(...values),span=hi-lo||1;const points=values.map((v,i)=>[i/(values.length-1)*940+10,220-(v-lo)/span*185]);const path=points.map((p,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+p.join(',')).join(' ');$('chart').className='';$('chart').innerHTML='<svg viewBox="0 0 960 260" role="img" aria-label="'+name+' 최근 7일 가격 그래프"><defs><linearGradient id="fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#239b8b" stop-opacity=".18"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#239b8b" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs>'+[35,95,155,220].map(y=>'<path d="M10 '+y+' H950" stroke="#edf1f4"/>').join('')+'<path d="'+path+' L950,240 L10,240 Z" fill="url(#fill)"/><path d="'+path+'" fill="none" stroke="#239b8b" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg>';$('range').textContent='7일 최저 '+money(lo)+' · 최고 '+money(hi)}async function load(){if(busy)return;busy=true;$('refresh').disabled=true;$('status').textContent='CoinGecko 시장 데이터를 확인하고 있습니다.';try{const r=await fetch('data/markets-'+currency+'.json',{cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)throw Error();const data=await r.json();if(!Array.isArray(data.coins)||!coins.every(c=>data.coins.some(x=>x.id===c[0])))throw Error();market=data.coins;const date=new Date(data.fetched_at);$('status').textContent='● CoinGecko · 자료 수집 '+(isNaN(date)?'시각 미확인':date.toLocaleString('ko-KR'))+' · 거래소 실시간 시세와 다를 수 있습니다.'}catch{market=[];$('status').textContent='API 연결 대기 · CoinGecko 키를 연결하면 가격과 그래프가 표시됩니다.'}finally{render();draw();busy=false;$('refresh').disabled=false}}function reportCard(r,latest=false){const a=document.createElement('article');a.className='report';const cover=document.createElement('div');cover.className='pdf-cover';cover.textContent='PDF';if(r.cover){const img=document.createElement('img');img.src=encodeURI(r.cover);img.alt=r.title+' 표지';img.loading='lazy';img.onerror=()=>{cover.className='pdf-cover';cover.textContent='PDF'};cover.replaceChildren(img);cover.className='';}a.append(cover);const content=document.createElement('div');const tag=document.createElement('span');tag.className='tag';tag.textContent=(latest?'최신 자료 · ':'')+(r.date_label||'등록일')+' '+r.period;const title=document.createElement('h3');title.textContent=r.title;const desc=document.createElement('p');desc.textContent=r.description+' · '+(r.size/1024/1024).toFixed(1)+' MB';const actions=document.createElement('div');actions.className='report-actions';for(const [text,download]of [['PDF 읽기 ↗',false],['다운로드 ↓',true]]){const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=encodeURI(r.file).replace(/#/g,'%23').replace(/\?/g,'%3F');link.textContent=text;if(download)link.download=r.file.split('/').pop();else{link.target='_blank';link.rel='noopener'}actions.append(link)}content.append(tag,title,desc,actions);a.append(content);return a}function renderArchive(){const list=$('archive-list');list.replaceChildren();const q=$('search').value.toLowerCase();const filtered=reports.filter(r=>(r.title+' '+r.period).toLowerCase().includes(q));for(const r of filtered)list.append(reportCard(r));if(!filtered.length){const p=document.createElement('p');p.className='empty';p.textContent='검색 결과가 없습니다.';list.append(p)}}function renderReports(){$('report-list').replaceChildren();if(reports.length)$('report-list').append(reportCard(reports[0],true));else $('report-list').textContent='등록된 PDF가 없습니다.';$('report-count').textContent=reports.length+'개';$('more-reports').disabled=!reports.length;renderArchive()}$('more-reports').onclick=()=>{const open=$('report-archive').hidden;$('report-archive').hidden=!open;$('more-reports').textContent=open?'접기 ↑':'더보기 →';$('more-reports').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));};$('refresh').onclick=load;$('currency').onchange=e=>{currency=e.target.value;load()};$('search').oninput=renderArchive;fetch('reports.json').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error();return r.json()}).then(r=>{reports=r;renderReports()}).catch(()=>{$('report-list').textContent='간행물 목록을 불러오지 못했습니다. 새로고침해 주세요.'});render();load();